I don't know if this is reasonable but I would suggest along with
hunger a character should get thirsty.  Quaffing water (potions, mote,
and fountain) would give the longest time before being thirsty again 
(Holy Water would give a bonus).  Some food would be better at delivering
water (peaches more than bananas) and some food will suck up the water
in the characters system (pancakes). 

This may require making potions of water more plentiful, or having
a ring of thirst quenching. 

I can imagine facing the choice... "Do I bless my sword or do I quaff
my last potion of Holy Water?"

